upply Gap is Widening and Colleges are NOT investing in new hostels<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Running hostels is not their core business<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Capital constraints<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Dated designs that fail to attract students<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Grade A Student Accommodation currently &lt;5% of total beds<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">FirstDorm fills this void with a zero\u2011cost, professionally managed model that benefits colleges, students, and investors.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Compared to mature markets like United Kingdom and United States, India remains early-cycle.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>3.7M+ beds required<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>4% CAGR student growth<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>&lt;5% organised Grade A supply<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Fragmented ownership<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">FirstDorm is building a scalable captive student housing platform designed for long-term capital.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Our Scalable, Capital-Efficient Business Model, creates value across the entire student housing lifecycle for all stakeholders &#8211; from development to operations &#8211; capturing multiple revenue streams.<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-fe48e5de wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-theme-palette-12-background-color has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/firstdorm.infinityfreeapp.com\/contact\/\">Explore Investment Opportunities<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:25px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n","protected":